  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 有 $\\max \\{1, t^2\\} = \\begin{cases} 1, & |t| \\leqslant 1 \\\\ t^2, & |t| > 1 \\end{cases}$ ，这是分段函数的积分，要分别对 $|x^3 - 1| \\leqslant 1$ 与 $|x^3 - 1| > 1$ 的情况做讨论，确定被积函数式，再做积分.\n\n当 $|x^3 - 1| \\leqslant 1$ 时，即 $0 \\leqslant x \\leqslant \\sqrt[3]{2}$ ，"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t = \\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} d t = x ^ {3} - 1.\n$$\n\n当 $x^{3} - 1 > 1$ 时，即 $x > \\sqrt[3]{2}$\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t = \\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t + \\int_ {1} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t = 1 + \\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} t ^ {2} d t = \\frac {2}{3} + \\frac {1}{3} (x ^ {3} - 1) ^ {3}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "当 $x^{3} - 1 < 1$ 时，即 $x < 0$\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t = \\int_ {0} ^ {- 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t + \\int_ {1} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t = - \\frac {2}{3} + \\frac {1}{3} (x ^ {3} - 1) ^ {3}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "综上\n\n$$\n\\int_ {0} ^ {x ^ {3} - 1} \\max \\{1, t ^ {2} \\} d t = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} - \\frac {2}{3} + \\frac {1}{3} (x ^ {3} - 1) ^ {3}, & x <   0, \\\\ x ^ {3} - 1, & 0 \\leqslant x \\leqslant \\sqrt [ 3 ]{2}, \\\\ \\frac {2}{3} + \\frac {1}{3} (x ^ {3} - 1) ^ {3}, & x > \\sqrt [ 3 ]{2}. \\end{array} \\right.\n$$"
      }
    ],
